  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Third Phase of the Central Asia Regional Links Program (CARs-3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective of the proposed Third Phase of the Central Asia Regional Links Program (CARs-3 Project) is to increase regional connectivity and support sustainable tourism development in Issyk-Kul Oblast.</narrative>
